Because the Poly TC8 ships with an older rev of the imx8mm evk along with kernel 5.10 we are using Yocto hardknott to get a working build before porting it up to kernel 6.0+

Check here for more info on Yocto release versions
https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Releases

This will eventually be ported to Scarthgap or Walnascar but due to some compatibility issues, this is the only supported Yocto version for now.


This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-poly-tc8 layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

